      "id": "https://www.strangerfoods.org/recipes/pineapple-fried-cauliflower-rice-bowl",
      "url": "https://www.strangerfoods.org/recipes/pineapple-fried-cauliflower-rice-bowl",
      "title": "Pineapple fried cauliflower rice bowl",
      "content_html": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;\">Pineapple fried cauliflower rice bowl</h1>\n        <br>\n        <img src=\"https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/pineapple-fried-cauliflower-rice-bowl.webp\" style=\"text-align:center;\"/>\n        <br>\n        <p style=\"font-family:sans-serif;>The star of this bowl is the pineapple, which peaks in late spring and into early summer and adds a subtle sweetness to an otherwise savory compilation of vegetables, including mushrooms and peppers. Unlike traditional fried rice, this bowl uses cauliflower rice. Because it reheats well, I tend to make twice the amount I need so I can enjoy another meal of it during the week.</p>",
      "image": "https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/pineapple-fried-cauliflower-rice-bowl.webp",
      "date_published": "2026-07-12T00:00:00+00:00Z",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://www.strangerfoods.org/recipes/zaatar-spiced-meatballs-with-tomatoes-bulgur",
      "url": "https://www.strangerfoods.org/recipes/zaatar-spiced-meatballs-with-tomatoes-bulgur",
      "title": "Za\u2019atar spiced meatballs with tomatoes & bulgur",
      "content_html": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;\">Za\u2019atar spiced meatballs with tomatoes & bulgur</h1>\n        <br>\n        <img src=\"https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/zaatar-spiced-meatballs-with-tomatoes-bulgur.webp\" style=\"text-align:center;\"/>\n        <br>\n        <p style=\"font-family:sans-serif;>These simply spiced meatballs with parsley and feta work beautifully cooked with bulgur wheat and tomatoes for a really lovely all-in-one meal. I like making the meatballs fairly small, to sit on top of the bulgur \u2013 you need nothing more than a little natural yogurt alongside to serve.</p>",
      "image": "https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/zaatar-spiced-meatballs-with-tomatoes-bulgur.webp",
      "date_published": "2026-07-11T00:00:00+00:00Z",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
